  {
    id: '17',
    title: 'Courtesy Visit to His Excellency Major General (Retd) Sohail Ahmad Khan, High Commissioner of Pakistan',
    excerpt: 'A diplomatic visit with Pakistan\'s High Commissioner to strengthen bilateral relations and explore new avenues for trade and commerce.',
    content: 'KASCOTE delegation met with His Excellency Major General (Retd) Sohail Ahmad Khan, the High Commissioner of Pakistan to Nigeria, in a strategic diplomatic engagement aimed at strengthening Nigeria-Pakistan relations and exploring new opportunities for bilateral trade and business partnerships.\n\nVisit Objectives\n\nDiplomatic Relations\n- Strengthen Nigeria-Pakistan bilateral business ties\n- Create government-level support for commerce\n- Facilitate business introductions and partnerships\n- Explore South Asian trade opportunities\n\nKey Discussion Areas\n\nTrade and Commerce\n- Current bilateral trade volume and trends\n- High-demand products and sectors\n- Export opportunities for Nigerian businesses\n- Pakistani manufacturing and export capabilities\n\nBusiness Facilitation\n- Visa and travel procedures for delegations\n- Government support for business missions\n- Trade finance and banking relationships\n- Regulatory framework and compliance\n\nIndustry Opportunities\n\nPakistani Strengths\n- Textile and garment manufacturing excellence\n- Leather goods and footwear production\n- Sports equipment and manufacturing\n- Pharmaceutical and chemical industries\n- Agricultural products and processing\n\nNigerian Market Potential\n- Consumer goods and retail opportunities\n- Agricultural exports and commodities\n- Minerals and raw materials\n- Energy sector partnerships\n\nStrategic Outcomes\n- High Commissioner\'s commitment to supporting business engagement\n- Facilitation of business delegations and visits\n- Introduction to key Pakistani business organizations\n- Information on market entry and business registration\n- Invitation to embassy-hosted business events\n\nThis diplomatic visit broadened KASCOTE\'s international network to include South Asian connections, opening new pathways for members seeking to engage with Pakistani businesses and access South Asian markets. The High Commissioner\'s support provides crucial government backing for sustained business relationships.',
    imageUrl: 'KASCOTEN IMAGES/visitations/pakistan-ambassador-visit.jpg',
    category: 'visitations',
    author: 'KASCOTE International Relations',
    publishedAt: new Date(2025, 5, 10),
